  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Highway, Street, and Bridge Construction (NAICS 237310) obligations were $1.8B in FY2026 to date. The program produced 1,679 awards with an average award size of $1.1M, and obligations were up 52.8% year over year. FY2026 to date is a partial total for the fiscal year. Historical fiscal-year obligations show $1.9B in FY21, $2.1B in FY22, $2.8B in FY23, $2.6B in FY24, and $1.2B in FY25, followed by the current $1.8B in FY26 to date.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "How has federal spending for NAICS 237310 changed over recent fiscal years?",
        "body": "FY21 obligations were $1.9B. FY22 obligations were $2.1B. FY23 obligations were $2.8B, FY24 obligations were $2.6B, and FY25 obligations were $1.2B. FY26 obligations to date are $1.8B, and obligations were up 52.8% year over year."
      },
